<section class="case-study-section"><h3>Context</h3><p>Talking Paintings is the product context for this work. The dashboard supports teams creating and preparing its AI-powered characters by bringing character information, source documents, generated knowledge, review and training-data preparation into one controlled workflow.</p><p>It is a production tool within the wider product ecosystem, not the complete runtime system.</p></section>
