<section class="case-study-section"><h3>Implementation</h3><div class="case-study-card-grid"><article><h4>Character Setup</h4><p>Interfaces collect and manage the information needed to define a new Talking Paintings character.</p></article><article><h4>Document Processing</h4><p>Uploaded source documents are parsed and normalized into content suitable for knowledge preparation.</p></article><article><h4>Knowledge Generation</h4><p>OpenAI API integration supports structured knowledge-base generation followed by human review and editing.</p></article><article><h4>Training-Data Preparation</h4><p>The tool prepares training examples for later model fine-tuning; it does not present this preparation step as model training.</p></article><article><h4>Validation &amp; Testing</h4><p>Data checks, operational controls and automated tests help keep content dependable before handoff.</p></article></div></section>
